    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a story of a mermaid, who reign over the world of darkness.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another EPHEMERAL follows the world of the otome game &quot;EPHEMERAL&quot; and was created by the same staff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;EPHEMERAL -MINIATURE GARDEN-&quot;, a text ADV distributed through the iOS/Andoroid app game &quot;My Lovey:Choose your\u00a0otome\u00a0story&quot;, is now available on Steam.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25cfNotes.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThis work is identical in content to &quot;EPHEMERAL -MINIATURE GARDEN&quot; distributed through the &quot;My Lovey:Choose your\u00a0otome\u00a0story&quot; iOS/Android app.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThis game is based on the app version, so it will be displayed in portrait resolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThere are no in-game fees.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25cfGame System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000As you read the story, choices will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Depending on the choice you make, the story will change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Card illustrations can be obtained according to the number of times you play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000A gallery mode is also available to view card illustrations and stills from the app version of the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25cfStory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000The main character, a mermaid, is caught up for a crime she didn't commit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000She ends up in a small box garden where a certain race of people is quarantined.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25cfCharacter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386250/extras/f255a14006ef4e2c5b28f3df01a1f215.avif?t=1742862931\" width=350 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Hisui</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 <i><strong>&quot;If you loathe that much to be a caretaker\u2500\u2500simply get out of here and run.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u3000\u3000He has a large burn scar on his face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000He is always quiet and distant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386250/extras/51379e4f372ab2dcae6b829fed0952ac.avif?t=1742862931\" width=350 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Rion</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 <i><strong>&quot;You idiot, you're not in the position to be making any choices.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000He has a foul-mouthed and belligerent personality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000She and the protagonist are similar in some ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000She is not good at studying, but she can do housework and cleaning as well as anyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386250/extras/eb06f909c1a08b6b95caa7f9ffc85e88.avif?t=1742862931\" width=350 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Yugu</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 <i><strong>&quot;You idiot, you're not in the position to be making any choices.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000A young man who smiles kindly and treats everyone equally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000His beauty and charisma are unmatched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386250/extras/466eb476ed4c37b0d48f45f248e284a7.avif?t=1742862931\" width=350 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Aria</u></strong>(*Name can be changed.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 <u><strong>&quot;I did not murder anyone. There's no crime I need to be punished for.&quot;</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u3000\u3000Protagonist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000Living as a mermaid of the highest rank in the Underworld, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000she is a proud and naive girl, but meeting them forces her to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
